OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school faces closure for
OL,4,Asecond time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school is facing a renewed
OL,7,Fthreat of closure, just months after an
OL,8,Feducation body halted a decision to
OL,9,Fclose its doors.
OL,11,FThe future of Hazlewood Community
OL,12,FPrimary School, in Wideopen, has been
OL,13,Fthrown into question yet again, with
OL,14,FNorth Tyneside Council bosses saying
OL,15,Fthere is no viable way to rebuild a
OL,16,Fsite in need of major repairs.
OL,18,FFamilies celebrated earlier this year
OL,19,Fwhen the Office of the Schools
OL,20,FAdjudicator (OSA) blocked a plan to
OL,21,Fclose Hazlewood and merge it with
OL,22,Fnearby Greenfields Primary School.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
